<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Light (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 12), Paladin (guild level 12)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast light &lt;object&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast light</a>   (on the room you are in)
</pre>
<p>Makes an object, or the room you stand in, give off light for a while, so you 
can see in the dark. Cast it on something you carry or wear, and the light 
goes where you go.
</p><p>The better your creation sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. It doesn't add up: something already lit by the spell stays 
as it is. You must be standing. It is also found on staffs, scrolls and 
wands.
</p><p>For lighting a torch or lantern, see <a cmd='#'>Help Light</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Light</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Magic Candle</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Continual Light</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>